{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_title", "source_sha256": "ceacf2be70ca2b3c02206b00ad0d859d432aa02b8d92481c63d51c4d31129ca2", "ja": "そして、輝く君であれ", "zh": "愿你成为闪耀的自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_synopsis", "source_sha256": "88cb9c03c1c1d187a9629b2e457824e6d68bc3046a439bd51fe1448394f4a395", "ja": "苦手だった歌を褒められるようになり、新曲\nお披露目公演を前に上機嫌な歩。だが兄が\n公演を観にくる事になると、様子が一変。\n「何故アイドルになったのか」。その言葉に\n思いを新たにした歩は、改めて決意する。", "zh": "曾经不擅长的歌唱得到了夸奖，在新歌\n亮相公演前，步的心情非常好。然而当得知\n哥哥要来看公演后，她的态度却为之一变。\n“为什么成为了偶像呢”。因这句话而重新\n坚定了心意的步，再一次下定了决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73411cddb71add8b65d7f5e221976d636e2d8dea3e4bc33d381cbf405e7659af", "ja": "（歩の新曲が終わった。\nみんな、歩の歌に釘付けだったな……）", "zh": "（步的新歌结束了。\n大家都看得入迷了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6cdcebe7a5276a03ed6b113f72573714f02c7d897313b610c95f87eb737244cd", "ja": "アタシの曲、『Get My Shinin'』でした！\nみんな、どうだったー！？", "zh": "刚才是我的歌曲《Get My Shinin'》！\n大家觉得怎么样——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "8683cb77fae45e81efa1190eb86b51ce028ac1a414c7b7b7216b5e1873242e16", "ja": "ワアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "97c7b9d6a553fde41df93c03c24a1499c25fb80f9145d154d99920eed6af683a", "ja": "ありがとー！　アタシ、今回の公演で気づいたんだ！\nアタシはまだまだ、未熟なところもあるけど……。", "zh": "谢谢——！我在这次公演中明白了一件事！\n虽然我还有很多不成熟的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "04ad543477bed90dc26f24ad6e61e19606b022f7ca4c099a01e119222db142db", "ja": "でも、これからもアイドルとしてがんばるから！\nだからその……みんな、応援よろしくっ！", "zh": "不过，我今后也会继续努力，作为一名偶像加油的！\n所以那个……今后也请大家多多支持啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "8683cb77fae45e81efa1190eb86b51ce028ac1a414c7b7b7216b5e1873242e16", "ja": "ワアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0c9aa9ec49b9a3c347835050427864d8f17c6f79f2d45ae9a2d3ddaecbcb1a70", "ja": "{$P$}、みんな、お疲れ！\nああ～、めちゃくちゃ緊張した～！", "zh": "{$P$}，大家辛苦啦！\n啊啊～紧张死我了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "862ff8a474e2a94c5d1cd92eff329df4518b717a9dabd1ffce7bf00004a2237b", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩！\nみんなも、いいステージだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，步！\n大家的演出也很棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be2629c64711ed34090ae4fbe488ef4f9cd1d7e0a5f44f3d83e1008bc9ed3e4c", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}。\nみんなも、いろいろ心配かけてごめん。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}。\n也让大家担心了这么多，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c54a72e827939838604b69e2b4496caf891c27acb622dbf722dace860dd1eaa5", "ja": "最後までやり切れたのは、みんなのおかげだと思う！\n本当に、ありがとう！", "zh": "能坚持到最后，都是大家的功劳！\n真的，谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "9d8c9e766663c120786546af05625480da4d1517a4b9d5460a827d7143b030d2", "ja": "仲間として、当然のことですが……\n歩さんは、世話の焼ける方ですね～。ふふっ。", "zh": "作为伙伴，这是理所当然的事，不过……\n步还真是个让人操心的人呢～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "874ce03ff3ab622a72c9745efcce16db29c1ffaa94f49ae5fcfb810a52e5c7eb", "ja": "本当だよ、心配かけさせてさ～。\nま、歩らしいけど！", "zh": "真的呢，还让人这么担心～。\n不过，这倒是很有步的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "ea34c1890b6fe40a54dffa20baedb34434804f28b72fb0cd0f148bd0405fddef", "ja": "でも今日のライブ見たら、あゆあゆの兄ちゃんも\n「まいった！」って言うんじゃない？", "zh": "不过看了今天的演唱会，步步的哥哥也会说“真服了！”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "170e85c1ca3ef5292f397c3ee20b37be43444886e17cadcf1fd11ab081491273", "ja": "そうですね～。歩さんのお兄さんにすごいところを\n見せられるよう、みんなで、がんばりましたし～。", "zh": "是啊～为了让步小姐的哥哥看到我们厉害的一面，大家都一起努力了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3a0a4179da210d340a029b111e857a86c47f3e972c100518112100b437e87bb3", "ja": "そうだといいけど……あはは。", "zh": "希望如此吧……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e8c641da8a7144304a758c111c022cff112acca2dddd326ffb28299bdf32d7b", "ja": "……おっと。盛り上がってるところすまないが、歩。\nそのお兄さんが、待ってるみたいだ。", "zh": "……哎呀。虽然聊得正起劲很不好意思，步。\n你哥哥好像在等你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b48a2b13879225bc66a62f81cd14d89ff0bcc7cd5f97a61e095049a85f45f6d9", "ja": "ええっ、兄貴が！？", "zh": "诶——哥哥在等我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9bc131895f103d50f470e0c52d1dd330670437adf56c46a1bd60ffbdc6ff018a", "ja": "あ、アタシ、ちょっと行ってくる！\nみんな、先に着替えてて！", "zh": "啊，我先去一下！\n大家先换好衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "b82990630a20739e84ffbaff89a96ade8b05dea72ec307bb89e87ef096fdce01", "ja": "歩さん、なんだか不安そうな顔をしていました～。\nやっぱり、お兄さんには緊張するんでしょうか～。", "zh": "步小姐刚才看起来一副有些不安的样子～。\n果然，面对哥哥还是会紧张吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "7d9a487ff4f4052eefbaa2038ec5adcfe718a2ecd594b54bd5d2bca4af46732e", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n行ってあげたらどうですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生也\n过去陪陪她怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c0a12030444a88246980929aa05f4f0ea28204eaae93d7f280740d4624cbd009", "ja": "ああ、そうするよ。\nみんなは、先に帰りの準備をしておいてくれ！", "zh": "啊，我去一趟吧。\n大家先准备好回去的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "59c05276ad2620a276b7d6133c9a66f63e14c894fec00642a34e00a345a48c51", "ja": "あっ、兄貴！　えっと、その……。", "zh": "啊，老哥！那个，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1023_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "3446b423377473f9bd5fb2b66bdfb416d92d459269d9dbeaa90a8387ef5c9312", "ja": "お疲れ、歩。\nやっぱり、俺の言ったとおりだったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，步。  \n果然和我说的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1025_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "0c4f3dc07c340d258e27b7ab63e2fd660a61f6252c2a5eb589bd9976869956ce", "ja": "日本に帰ってきて正解だったろ？", "zh": "回到日本是正确的选择吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2efbd12ab5a1e12ee26ce9b82a46c60f08d657314eb78ab495e232fcccf90c75", "ja": "えっと……あのさ、それ、どういう意味？", "zh": "那个……我说，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1027_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "15ed30a55cbf6e23d68d4aca2eb7139fb681dcce201323a69d036d89a2131467", "ja": "だってお前、自分で踊りたかったんだろ？\n人の振り付けをするんじゃなくて。", "zh": "因为你想亲自跳舞，对吧？\n而不是给别人编舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1029_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "915043e159d24702e4fd69278636cc0b61a64c3973da6ee4e4ea4367da6cfd14", "ja": "だったら、アメリカでくすぶってる場合じゃない。\nいやアメリカでもいいけど、お前、英語が……。", "zh": "那样的话，就不能继续窝在美国了。\n\n不，待在美国也行，可你的英语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6b6ab5d832ac0ff2ad9e2163b4b8e0c7642cf0abbc663dc17b20219515140b3a", "ja": "わー！？　そ、それは今、言わないでー！！", "zh": "哇！？那、那个现在先别说——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7c826d4526daf0f33e82731d7c792bcde9c35a22f3f557d9d61940438d54a159", "ja": "あ、いたいた。\n……歩、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，在这儿呢。\n……小步，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf90e964115fa6b60d14f14dd1b7fc8a89a7536e596be7c2287f755a72814c60", "ja": "{$P$}！\nいやっ、なんでもないよ！　ノープロブレム！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n没、没什么啦！No problem！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1033_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "cfd905b1e51fd6693dc1655a1a875e89398bdda99ef0df6471a24097f11d9868", "ja": "……まあとにかく、俺は日本のほうが、\n意外とお前に合ってるんじゃないかと思ったんだ。", "zh": "……总而言之，我觉得日本\n说不定意外地很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a9e3e4bc62d986198327d127dceed984279d8a72f3d506a753e67657ea410e6", "ja": "えっ。じゃあ兄貴が、アタシに\n『日本に帰ったほうがいい』って言ったのって……。", "zh": "咦。那哥哥对我说“还是回日本比较好”，原来是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1035_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "bc527645dd5e7e7b198cc499b74d15a727046fa1c168aa283aed1bbf5fb604bd", "ja": "お前が俺のマネして、裏方をしようとしてたから。\nホント、小さい頃からすぐマネするんだもんな。", "zh": "因为你学着我，也想去做幕后工作啊。  \n真是的，你从小就总爱学我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1036_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "b18291fc1b69a6a54ef0643901aa6d60cfcd85b96d6cdf49e5d4f8e74f97be28", "ja": "俺はお前と違って、振付師の仕事が何より好きなんだ。\nお前とは、たぶん目指すものが違うんだよ。", "zh": "我和你不一样，我最喜欢的就是编舞师的工作。\n我和你大概追求着不同的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8994e781934075b8db26f81029425bba645b4bf7b04706eedb9418267acb5ba2", "ja": "……そうだったの？　アタシ……アタシは\nてっきり、兄貴に呆れられたんだとばかり……。", "zh": "……是这样吗？我……我还以为，哥哥已经对我失望透顶了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0bcc89bdda9d7c5ec430a92e4ea755a1a29ceca303028a2429833cf4eaa5b0ac", "ja": "ぐすっ……。\nひっく……う、うわぁ～ん！", "zh": "呜……。\n呜呜……呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1039_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "cc11e66ebbde6bb29c7a6a2c38f74719da44af9687d577ef311f9b6808375fae", "ja": "わっ、歩！？　泣くなよ！\nまったく、泣き虫なんだから……。", "zh": "哇，步！？别哭啊！\n真是的，真是个爱哭鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1040_p", "source_sha256": "04b6498713c5ffdca71209f464a7e3f6e173f8f31a0ed93602e70267b2c2b145", "ja": "大丈夫か？　歩。\nほら、ハンカチ。", "zh": "没事吧？步。\n来，手帕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_093_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "af6ade04c150d945549617617291180d5ae00b8b163c11f2d39a0529f44e8874", "ja": "ぐすっ……う、うん。\nありがと、{$P$}……。", "zh": "抽泣……嗯、嗯。\n谢谢你，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
